      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Obsidan effectiveness was examined in 42 coronary patients. Good clinical effect was achieved in 81% of patients with angina of effort and 64% of patients with angina of effort and angina at rest. Exercise tolerance increased in half of the patients. Radionuclide scintigraphy with 201Tl showed a reduction of exercise-induced transitory myocardial ischemia zones, a finding indicative of obsidan favourable effect on coronary microcirculation reserve."},
